{"id":"100714","t":{"th":null,"ro":"Jashin-chan Dropkick","en":"Dropkick on My Devil!","na":"邪神ちゃんドロップキック"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100714-1glYB8znGJ5W.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx100714-1glYB8znGJ5W.png","color":"#e4e435","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100714-frMoYtJu32jK.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":11,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2018,"start":"2018-07-10","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"score":67,"pop":45913,"studio":"Nomad","desc":"The demon Jashin-chan has been summoned to Earth by Yurine Hanazono, a girl with a knack for the occult. Unfortunately, Yurine does not actually know how to send Jashin-chan back to Hell. Now stuck on Earth, she must live at Yurine's apartment as her familiar.\n\nThe only way for Jashin-chan to return would be to kill her summoner, but this is easier said than done for the incompetent demon. Since Jashin-chan is immortal and can regenerate her body, Yurine does not hold back in attacking her with a range of weapons, punishing her in gruesome manners for her evil schemes. Jashin-chan is also often visited by her demon friends: the kindhearted Gorgon Medusa and the energetic minotaur Minosu, who seem much more well-behaved in contrast, and disapprove of her plans to kill Yurine.","descTh":"ปีศาจ Jashin-chan ถูกเรียกมายังโลกโดย Yurine Hanazono เด็กสาวผู้มีความสามารถพิเศษด้านไสยศาสตร์ น่าเสียดายที่ยูริเนะไม่รู้ว่าจะส่งจาชินจังกลับนรกได้อย่างไร ตอนนี้ติดอยู่บนโลก เธอต้องอาศัยอยู่ที่อพาร์ตเมนต์ของยูรีนเหมือนที่เธอคุ้นเคย\n\nวิธีเดียวที่จาชินจังจะกลับมาคือการฆ่าผู้อัญเชิญของเธอ แต่พูดง่ายกว่าทำกับปีศาจไร้ความสามารถ เนื่องจากจาชินจังเป็นอมตะและสามารถสร้างร่างกายใหม่ได้ ยูรีนจึงไม่ลังเลที่จะโจมตีเธอด้วยอาวุธหลากหลายชนิด และลงโทษเธอด้วยท่าทางอันน่าสยดสยองสำหรับแผนการชั่วร้ายของเธอ Jashin-chan มักจะถูกเพื่อนปีศาจของเธอมาเยี่ยมบ่อยครั้ง เช่น Gorgon Medusa ผู้ใจดี และ Minotaur Minosu ผู้มีพลัง ซึ่งดูประพฤติตนดีกว่ามากในทางตรงกันข้าม และไม่เห็นด้วยกับแผนการของเธอที่จะฆ่า Yurine","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"xx70T2tgrwg","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/100714","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/36906","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"crunchyroll","r":"TH","u":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/series/G62487M9Y","lang":"en","eps":[["1","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/G31UXZ154/episode-1",1686688200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/9f218eb2fac355c7bd372227d2c7e9b8.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["3","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/G2XU0DKZX/episode-3",1686688200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/7077df9e1f1181fc246bae50289b6aee.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["5","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GZ7UV1KNM/episode-5",1686688200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/dd4bc97c784ae9d3a121d5b611af8cea.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["7","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GG1U2Z97K/episode-7",1686688200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/050e3eac825e0b785c0e7e168c878ba4.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["9","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/G7PU4JEKW/episode-9",1686688200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/94d4142aeac4760f1a112d39f7efa726.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["11","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/G4VUQ89PE/episode-11",1686688200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/24c38a97ca03d95794d012f6301ff18d.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium","fin":1}],["2","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GPWUKD739/episode-2",1686663000,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/e2a676a51a65c087b3b1668144d2f784.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["4","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/G8WUN0X9V/episode-4",1686663000,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/7eba81af98ea42e6c5f89db93f01ed78.png",null,{"d":1420,"a":"premium"}],["6","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GQJUGQJ4M/episode-6",1686663000,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/553fda67852df5b6383621fd922b996b.p